Name:Rules pilot 316 - The Shadow is a 13/13 in exile
Goal:Survive
Turns:1
Difficulty:Medium
Description:It is your first main phase. You have Duplicant and Fling in hand with eight red mana floating. The opponent is at 12 life and controls Death's Shadow (a 1/1 right now) and Hill Giant. Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:rulesguru-f01c8c5f1ddcd809 | Death's Shadow's -X/-X works only on the battlefield (CR 113.6), so in exile it is a 13/13, and Duplicant takes the power and toughness of the card it exiled: exile the Shadow, not the bigger-looking Hill Giant, and Fling a 13/13 Duplicant
